  "lessons": [
    {
      "at": "2026-10-26T07:38:13+00:00",
      "capability": "",
      "capability_version": "",
      "lesson": "The 2026-10-26 weekly review found no capability-registry.json, no audit log and no lessons store anywhere on the filesystem; the sandbox had been recycled, so every prior capability claim lived only in volatile storage. Fix implemented: the registry, its hash-chained audit log, the tooling and the tests now live in a git repository (github.com/saayad566-tech/apex-x-capability-registry) and CI re-validates them from a clean checkout.",
      "source": "weekly review 2026-10-26; filesystem search returned no registry",
      "status": "verified",
      "topic": "capability-registry-persistence"
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-26T07:38:14+00:00",
      "capability": "",
      "capability_version": "",
      "lesson": "The first seeding run exported one PYPI_SHA environment variable that every capability entry picked up, so all five entries recorded the pip-audit wheel digest as their artifact checksum. preflight.py caught it before commit with four 'artifact checksum mismatch' findings. Rule: compute an artifact digest at the point of use, never from a batch-scoped variable, and always run the fail-closed preflight over a freshly seeded registry before committing it.",
      "source": "seeding run 2026-10-26, preflight exit 1, four checksum mismatches",
      "status": "verified",
      "topic": "batch-seeding-shared-checksum"
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-26T07:38:14+00:00",
      "capability": "",
      "capability_version": "",
      "lesson": "pip-audit's default 'pip-audit -r requirements.txt' path failed here because it builds an isolated environment and tries to upgrade pip inside it. 'pip-audit --local' works and audits the running interpreter's distributions. When an advisory feed or the isolated-environment path is unavailable, the honest report is 'coverage unknown', never 'no vulnerabilities found'.",
      "source": "pip-audit 2.10.1 run 2026-10-26: isolated-env upgrade failed, --local returned exit 0",
      "status": "verified",
      "topic": "advisory-feed-vs-coverage"
    }
  ],
  "updated": "2026-10-26T07:38:14+00:00",
  "version": 3
